    "question": "What are the five steps of the agentic loop?",
    "options": {
      "a": "Plan, code, test, deploy, monitor",
      "b": "Prompt, LLM inference, tool execution, result feedback, continuation check",
      "c": "Read, write, edit, delete, save",
